Open the sidemenu
Click the 'Control Panel' sidemenu entry
Begin "Show the Inventory Sidemenu Tab"
	Click the "System" charttab
	Click the "Menu Editor" charttab subtab
	Type "Inventory" in the input
	Click the "Go" button
	Click the !Edit link
	Click the show_in_wc checkbox
	Click the "Change" button
	Verify exists "Successfully updated tab" text
Begin "Ensure memcache has the correct rxdb"
	Click the "System" charttab
	Click the "System Settings" charttab subtab
	Type "RXDB" in the input
	Click the "Go" button
	Click the 2nd !Edit link
	@@@ Get the current value
	e = driver.getElement(xpath="//textarea[@id='value']")
	return {
		'rxdb_dbname': e.get_attribute('value')
	}
	@@@
	Type '{rxdb_dbname}' in the !reason input
	Type "ugh_memcache" in the !value input
	Begin "Ignore log errors from the invalid rxdb database name"
